  <item>
    <title>老男人不是都油腻：“即便他才20岁，你觉得他年轻过吗？“</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6467732953a5e5ea14827fc2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6467732953a5e5ea14827fc2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 May 2023 13:01:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期真的毫无主题，本来打算请一位中年男子来现身说法讲讲一些年轻时从未想象过的精彩中年人生，结果着实高估了无选题状态下主持人及嘉宾的水平，所以变成了一档绝对意义上的茶余饭后散德行。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：温宏伟 《时尚先生》执行主编</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：大雁、马索</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾推荐的歌单及书：</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>Bob Dylan - One More Cup of Coffee</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>U2 - I Still Haven't Found What I'm Looking For</span></h2><span></span><h1><span>Bob Dylan - Brownsville Girl</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>Moss Hart《从布朗克斯到百老汇》</span><em><span>Act One</span></em></h1><span></span><h1><span>Bill Bryson《</span><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%87%E7%89%A9%E7%AE%80%E5%8F%B2" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%87%E7%89%A9%E7%AE%80%E5%8F%B2"><span>万物简史</span></a><span>》</span><em><span>A Short History of Nearly Everything</span></em></h1><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> “你们节目为什么叫弹性碰撞？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> 四十不惑“我现在的一切生活都是年轻时无法想象的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 在哈萨克斯坦的首都碰到了《新周刊》的社长大哥，让我看到了人到中年的另一种可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 人类进化中的废点vs沸点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a>“即便他才20岁，你觉得他年轻过吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 为什么他们拍不出来低俗小说那样的电影？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">12:09</a>“尖儿的多老都是尖儿，不尖儿的18也没用”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> “我选择的这份工作就像推土机一样推着我往前走”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1586">26:26</a> “我为什么不劝年轻人follow your dream，因为很多人从来追求的就不是梦想，其实是打着梦想旗号的金钱和虚妄”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a> 我的出身背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">35:01</a> AI、Chatgpt这些东西能代替编辑这个职业吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2964">49:24</a> “马索看到你照片就知道你养京巴犬”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3187">53:07</a> 我们都爱昆丁塔伦蒂诺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3643">1:00:43</a> 贾宏声与表演艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4514">1:15:14</a> “科幻电影里，人类的‘唯人类中心论’”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4827">1:20:27</a> 伍迪艾伦-从赤贫到扬名百老汇</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲爱的听众朋友们，弹性碰撞第三期上线啦。这期真是有点自娱自乐，但我们聊的很爽。如果您感兴趣请支持我们，并关注同名公粽号“弹性碰撞”及微博“弹性碰撞ElasticCollision”</span></p>]]></description>
